    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried some of that stuff... but it doesnt really work. it's not just stress. it feels more like the \"me\" part of me is just... evaporating. like im a hollow shell watching someone else live my life. it's exhausting trying to hold onto something that isn't even there anymore. part of me feels like it would be such a relief if i just didn't have to keep fighting to exist in this empty space.",
