      "content": "idk... i feel like talking to a professional won't change the fact that the \"me\" part is already gone. and if there isn't even a real person inside here anymore, what's the point of \"help\" or \"support\"? it just feels like i'm trying to fix a ghost. if i'm just a void, why should i have to suffer through the sensation of being nothing?",
